    <node id="act_poe2_act1">
      <data key="d1">Act 1 (Ogham)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">First PoE2 act, in the forests of Ogham and Clearfell. The Exile escapes execution, helps Una and Renly, frees the Hooded One, and ends by defeating Count Geonor; the Seed of Corruption flees east with the Countess.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">meta</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_campaign</data>
      <data key="d10">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": "~20 years after PoE1", "story_order": null}</data>
      <data key="d11">["act_poe2_act1"]</data>
      <data key="d12">canon</data>
      <data key="d13">high</data>
      <data key="d14">[{"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_act_1", "locator": "intro + Progression"}]</data>
      <data key="d15">["poe2_acts_1_3"]</data>
      <data key="d16">["poe2_campaign"]</data>
      <data key="d17">["meta"]</data>
      <data key="d18">released</data>
      <data key="d19">12</data>
      <data key="d20">3</data>
      <data key="d21">2</data>
      <data key="d22">2</data>
      <data key="d23">False</data>
    </node>
    <node id="act_poe2_act2">
      <data key="d1">Act 2 (Vastiri)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Second PoE2 act, in the Vastiri Desert and Keth. The Exile joins the Ardura Maraketh caravan, recreates the Horn of the Vastiri to dispel Jamanra's sandstorm, pursues the Countess to the Dreadnought, and learns the Hooded One is Sin.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">meta</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_campaign</data>
      <data key="d10">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": "~20 years after PoE1", "story_order": null}</data>
      <data key="d11">["act_poe2_act2"]</data>
      <data key="d12">canon</data>
      <data key="d13">high</data>
      <data key="d14">[{"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_act_2", "locator": "intro + Progression"}]</data>
      <data key="d15">["poe2_acts_1_3"]</data>
      <data key="d16">["poe2_campaign"]</data>
      <data key="d17">["meta"]</data>
      <data key="d18">released</data>
      <data key="d19">13</data>
      <data key="d20">3</data>
      <data key="d21">2</data>
      <data key="d22">2</data>
      <data key="d23">False</data>
    </node>
    <node id="act_poe2_act3">
      <data key="d1">Act 3 (Utzaal)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Third PoE2 act, in the jungles and drowned city of Utzaal. The Exile lowers the lake, enters the Vaal sites, is sent back in time via a gateway to Utzaal's past, and brings Doryani to the present.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">meta</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_campaign</data>
      <data key="d10">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": "~20 years after PoE1", "story_order": null}</data>
      <data key="d11">["act_poe2_act3"]</data>
      <data key="d12">canon</data>
      <data key="d13">high</data>
      <data key="d14">[{"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_act_3", "locator": "intro + Progression"}]</data>
      <data key="d15">["poe2_acts_1_3"]</data>
      <data key="d16">["poe2_campaign"]</data>
      <data key="d17">["meta"]</data>
      <data key="d18">released</data>
      <data key="d19">15</data>
      <data key="d20">3</data>
      <data key="d21">2</data>
      <data key="d22">2</data>
      <data key="d23">False</data>
    </node>
    <node id="act_poe2_act4">
      <data key="d1">Act 4 (Ngamakanui)</data>
      <data key="d2">["Act 4 (PoE2)"]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Fourth act of Path of Exile 2 (added in 0.3.0 The Third Edict). The Exile, the Hooded One and Doryani sail from Kingsmarch around the Karui archipelago Ngamakanui to recover three Precursor weapon pieces, find a forge, and reforge the Weapon meant to destroy the Beast, clashing with the Twilight Order and the Tukohama chieftain Tavakai.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">meta</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_campaign</data>
      <data key="d10">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": "~20 years after PoE1", "story_order": null}</data>
      <data key="d11">["act_poe2_act4"]</data>
      <data key="d12">canon</data>
      <data key="d13">high</data>
      <data key="d14">[{"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_act_4", "locator": "intro"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_act_4", "locator": "intro + Progression"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_the_search", "locator": "quest summary"}]</data>
      <data key="d15">["deep_history", "poe2_acts_4_plus"]</data>
      <data key="d16">["poe2_campaign"]</data>
      <data key="d17">["main_plot", "meta"]</data>
      <data key="d24">[{"domain": "deep_history", "summary": "PoE2's fourth act, set in the Karui archipelago of Ngamakanui, where the player searches for three pieces of the Precursor Weapon (and a way to assemble it) to subdue the Beast."}]</data>
      <data key="d18">released</data>
      <data key="d19">28</data>
      <data key="d20">2</data>
      <data key="d21">2</data>
      <data key="d22">2</data>
