    </node>
    <node id="act_poe2_act5">
      <data key="d1">Act 5 (Oriath)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Announced/datamined fifth act, not released as of 2026-11-05 (planned for the 1.0 release, 2026-12-11). Wiki text: set in Oriath, secretly rebuilt by the Twilight Order after Sirus destroyed it, where the player arrives in search of the Beast. Datamined listings name Slums, Grand Arena, Gardens, Den of Pleasure, Pantheon of the Forsaken Gods and bosses incl. Lumerius and the Countess; treat all details as unconfirmed.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">meta</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_campaign</data>
