    <node id="act_poe2_act6">
      <data key="d1">Act 6 (final act)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Announced sixth and final act of the PoE2 campaign, not released as of 2026-11-05. The PoE2 wiki only calls it the 'sixth and final storyline act'; no story content is confirmed. Rumours of its setting (e.g. inside the Beast) are unverified fan speculation.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">meta</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
