    <node id="act_poe2_epilogue">
      <data key="d1">Epilogue / Endgame (Legacy of the Precursors)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Endgame container (0.5.0) opened when the attempt to sail on Oriath ends at the Ziggurat Refuge: the Hooded One sleeps in corruption, Doryani builds a Waygate and the hunt for the Edicts begins. Distinct from PoE1's Epilogue.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">meta</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_endgame</data>
