    <node id="act_poe2_interlude1">
      <data key="d1">Interlude 1: Curse of Holten (Ezomytes)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">First Interlude after Act 4: the Hooded One takes the Exile to Ogham where Renly's Ezomytes are being abducted by Thane Wulfric and Lady Elswyth of Holten. Defeating them wins the Ezomytes for the war on Oriath. GGG reportedly intends Interludes to go away when Acts 5-6 arrive (non-canon status unverified).</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">meta</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_campaign</data>
      <data key="d10">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": null, "story_order": null}</data>
