    <node id="act_poe2_interlude2">
      <data key="d1">Interlude 2: The Stolen Barya (Maraketh)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Second Interlude: in the Vastiri, Sekhema Asala needs the Maraketh unified for war; the Sel Khari guardians of the First Barya are lost to a Faridun/Serpent Clan attack led by Prince Azmadi, whom the Exile defeats so the Gifting of Water can proceed.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">meta</data>
