    <node id="act_poe2_interlude3">
      <data key="d1">Interlude 3: Doryani's Contingency (Vaal)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Third Interlude: Doryani's reserves, the Cuachic Vault on Mount Kriar, are woken with the code phrase 'the time of the sparrow has come'; the Exile subdues Zolin and Zelina and the Cuachic Vaal pledge to the war.</data>
