      <data key="d24">[{"domain": "poe1_acts_6_10", "summary": "Artefact said to have power over life and death, placed in a shrine in the Quay by Veruso, Prima Imperialus, at the dawn of the Empire. Clarissa's ritual with it fails; she realises Veruso hid it out of fear over what it did to his wife Chiara and decides to destroy it."}]</data>
