    <node id="artifact_map_device">
      <data key="d1">Map Device</data>
      <data key="d2">["Atlas Device", "Atlas device"]</data>
      <data key="d3">artifact</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Ancient device of golden instruments that opens portals to the worlds of the Atlas. Per Valdo's Book of Memories it was built by the Watchers of Decay to travel to and lock the Elder's dreamland; Templar expeditions under High Templar Venarius found a broken one in Wraeclast's ruins and Valdo Caeserius (with the Shade's help) assembled it in the Oriath academy. Zana later found another in ruined Oriath; in the legacy epilogue Kirac rebuilt one from parts in the Vault of Venarius; Isla later reimagined it with Kalguuran runes. Different peoples are said to have built their own versions. No source in the corpus ties it to the Precursors.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d7">endgame_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">post_cataclysm</data>
      <data key="d10">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": null, "story_order": null}</data>
      <data key="d11">[]</data>
      <data key="d12">canon</data>
      <data key="d13">high</data>
      <data key="d14">[{"source_id": "src_poewiki_the_shaper_quest", "locator": "Memory of Intrigue: 'The intricate golden instruments ... a hundred times more intricate'"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_history_of_wraeclast", "locator": "Valdo Caeserius section"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_threads_of_the_originator", "locator": "Machinist's Vault Aberration quote: 'Different peoples created their own map devices'"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_the_watchers_of_decay", "locator": "lead + Book of Memories Page 9: 'The Watchers, they built the device'"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_picking_up_the_pieces", "locator": "Walkthrough: 'components to rebuild the Map Device' in the Vault of Venarius"}]</data>
      <data key="d15">["poe1_atlas"]</data>
      <data key="d16">["post_cataclysm"]</data>
