    <node id="artifact_precursor_weapon">
      <data key="d1">Precursor Weapon</data>
      <data key="d2">["Precursor Weapon", "Precursor Weapon (Weapon in pieces)", "Precursor anti-corruption weapon", "The Weapon (Precursor Weapon)", "The Weapon (instrument of the Third Edict)", "the Weapon"]</data>
      <data key="d3">artifact</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Device built by the Precursors against corruption; Doryani sought to harness it (a lore video says it was scattered by 400 BIC, Doryani holding one piece and three in the Karui archipelago). In PoE2 Act 4 the Exile hunts its three pieces in Ngamakanui; in the endgame only the Hooded One is said able to wield it against the Beast.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">precursor</data>
      <data key="d10">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": null, "story_order": null}</data>
      <data key="d11">["act_poe2_act3", "act_poe2_act4", "poe2_act4"]</data>
      <data key="d12">canon</data>
      <data key="d13">high</data>
      <data key="d14">[{"source_id": "src_poewiki_history_of_wraeclast", "locator": "Precursor civilization"}, {"source_id": "src_yt_1Zt4tv8fjI4", "locator": "[7:07]-[7:49]"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_act_4", "locator": "objective"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_legacy_of_the_vaal", "locator": "Quest log 'Speak to Doryani in Ziggurat Encampment' / Hooded One follow-up"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_the_search", "locator": "Witness the Hooded One reforge the Weapon; Return to Kingsmarch"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_the_search", "locator": "Speak to The Hooded One; Return to Kingsmarch"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_act_4", "locator": "intro: 'search for three parts of the precursor weapon'"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_legacy_of_the_vaal", "locator": "Doryani dialogue"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_act_4", "locator": "lead"}]</data>
      <data key="d15">["deep_history", "poe2_acts_1_3", "poe2_acts_4_plus", "twilight_order_edicts", "vaal"]</data>
      <data key="d16">["precursor", "poe2_campaign"]</data>
      <data key="d17">["main_plot"]</data>
      <data key="d24">[{"domain": "poe2_acts_1_3", "summary": "Ancient anti-Corruption weapon of a lost civilisation, in pieces: Doryani holds one, the others are scattered in Ngamakanui."}, {"domain": "poe2_acts_4_plus", "summary": "Three Precursor weapon pieces (rotating on Act 4 islands) are reforged by the Hooded One in the Excavated Site; the inscription reads 'The instrument of the Third Edict', made for cleansing Corruption and destroying the Beast. Radiates intense Corruption and drives Tavakai mad."}, {"domain": "twilight_order_edicts", "summary": "Three-piece Precursor device assembled in Act 4 on Arastas/Excavated Site; the instrument of the Third Edict, built to cleanse Corruption and destroy the Beast. Radiates intense Corruption, maddening those near it; Tavakai takes it, falls to blood fever, and is cured when the Hooded One uses it."}, {"domain": "vaal", "summary": "Ancient weapon from a lost civilisation designed against corruption; four pieces: Doryani holds one, three are scattered in Ngamakanui."}]</data>
      <data key="d18">released</data>
      <data key="d19">13</data>
      <data key="d20">2</data>
      <data key="d21">1</data>
      <data key="d22">1</data>
      <data key="d23">False</data>
