    <node id="char_ailith">
      <data key="d1">Ailith, First of the Keepers</data>
      <data key="d2">["Ailith"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Founder/leader of the Keepers of the Flame (Order of the Purple Flame) in the Monastery; in PoE1 3.27/3.28 she enlists the Exile against the Hiveborn at the Coast (Act 6), gives the Exile the flame to burn Hiveborn barriers and destroys Fortified Breaches. Author of The Word of the Dreamer. Revealed (Keepers league) to have died long ago: the Dreamer preserved her essence and keeps copies of her, burning and replacing her when she learns this. Also in PoE2.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">branch</data>
      <data key="d8">["breach", "keepers_of_the_flame"]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe1_leagues</data>
