      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Spirit of a woman killed by the King in the Mists (the 'King of the Nameless'), who once drew her and the Druid in as a supposed Maji; she appears near a Ritual Altar in a map, bound to the Wildwood/Caer Tarth area, and asks the Exile to destroy the King's effigies. She is the Druid's lost love (Druid dialogue: 'Aoife? You return to me once more!'). She is laid to rest after the Bodach falls.</data>
