      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Last Queen of the Vaal: vain, narcissistic ruler obsessed with eternal youth and beauty who demanded ever more sacrifice. Her pursuit of immortality with Doryani led to the Vaal Cataclysm; she ended trapped in a crimson nightmare realm. Boss in PoE1 (Apex of Sacrifice, Alluring Abyss/Uber, Throne of Atziri) and pinnacle boss (Atziri, the Red Queen) of PoE2's Fate of the Vaal.</data>
