    <node id="char_cadiro">
      <data key="d1">Cadiro Perandus</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Perandus family member and uncle of Emperor Chitus Perandus, who used his wealth to rig the Lord's Labyrinth in Chitus's favour. NPC of Perandus league (2.2.0) selling items for Perandus Coins from caches he hid after the Cataclysm; later available as Syndicate Research-safehouse/hideout NPC; named on the Elegant Hubris timeless jewel.</data>
