    <node id="char_hyrri">
      <data key="d1">Queen Hyrri Ngamaku</data>
      <data key="d2">["Hyrri"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Kaom's niece, archer, led Karui archers at Lioneye's Watch and the Karui at the Grain Gate; after Kaom's death guided the remaining 500 Karui families home, became queen, had a child with Victario (per wiki) and was succeeded by her daughter Ahuana; later vanished.</data>
