      <data key="d2">["Kalandra the trapped"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4">primordial entity</data>
      <data key="d5">Ancient being with an owl's body and human head, trapped in the Lake of Kalandra since the primordial era; she observes the world, scorns gods as 'thieves of virtue', and plans escape. Visited by the Order of the Djinn and the Clayshaper among others. Namesake of the Mirror of Kalandra.</data>
