      <data key="d2">["Medved, the Fallen Seer"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Leader of the Druids of the Broken Circle who claimed to peer into the past. He pioneered culling a horror species, challenged the horrors' leader alone and vanished. He returns as a horror boss in PoE1 (Medved, Feller of Heroes).</data>
