    <node id="char_tangmazu">
      <data key="d1">Tangmazu, the Raven Trickster</data>
      <data key="d2">["The Raven Trickster", "Tekaru (Karui)", "The Black Crow (Ezomyte)", "Strange Voice"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Trickster god, brother of Ralakesh, who tricked Solaris into believing Lunaris had betrayed her (PoE1 lore: Strange Voice in Delirium). In PoE2 0.5 he is the Raven Trickster whose defeat completes Strange Reflection and the Delirium storyline.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">branch</data>
