      <data key="d1">Tavakai, the Chieftain</data>
      <data key="d2">["Tavukai"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Chieftain of the Karui Tukohama Tribe and Act 4 boss. After the weapon is reforged he steals it and flees to Ngakanu with his daughter Makoru, falls to Blood Fever, claims to be the true 'Ngakuramakoi', is rejected by Tukohama, is defeated, then cured by Sin and pledges the Karui to the war against Oriana.</data>
