    <node id="char_the_arbiter_of_divinity">
      <data key="d1">The Arbiter of Divinity</data>
      <data key="d2">["Arbiter of Divinity"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4">pinnacle_boss</data>
      <data key="d5">Boss atop the Origin Tower, fought after the Origin Core is placed; it destroys Tecrod's body ('Your kind shall never ordain the First Edict!') and ends the threat of the First Edict. The wiki does not say what it is (the 'apex of the Origins of Divinity storyline' framing comes from guides); 0.5.4 patches later adjusted the fight.</data>
