    <node id="char_the_countess">
      <data key="d1">The Countess (Oriana)</data>
      <data key="d2">["Countess Oriana", "Oriana", "The Countess", "The Countess (Orianna) - Act 5"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Leader of the Twilight Order and antagonist of PoE2, who took the Seed of Corruption to create a new Beast. Escapes the Exile repeatedly during Acts 1-2; her son Lumerius is named in the wiki.</data>
