    <node id="char_the_dreamer">
      <data key="d1">The Dreamer</data>
      <data key="d2">["The Benevolent Dreamer", "The One Who Dreamt", "Chayula"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Keepers-league NPC (full name: Chayula, the Benevolent Dreamer / the One Who Dreamt) found hidden in the Monastery of the Keepers. After the failed fusion of the five Breachlords he was torn asunder and cast into the void; he gave Ailith visions and the Genesis Tree as weapon against the Hiveborn, calls the Exile an ally 'for now', and destroys Ailith's body when she learns the truth (she is a preserved Hiveborn copy).</data>
