      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d4">poet</data>
      <data key="d5">A Sarn poet and art critic who joined the Purity Rebellion, created the Ancient Graffiti in Sarn, and led the uprisings in the Slums and Docks. At the Night of a Thousand Ribbons ambush he shouted 'Death to Sin!'. Central figure of the comic Path of Exile: Origins.</data>
