    <node id="concept_ascension_trials">
      <data key="d1">Ascension Trials</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d4">trial_system</data>
      <data key="d5">PoE2's three-trial system (Sekhemas, Chaos, and a planned third) that gates ascendancy. Each trial is tied to a Wraeclastian culture. Four tiers of trials give 2 ascendancy points each for 8 total.</data>
