    <node id="concept_atlas">
      <data key="d1">The Atlas of Worlds (concept)</data>
      <data key="d2">["Atlas", "Atlas of Worlds"]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">The endgame structure of PoE1: a web of alternate worlds ('maps') reached through the Map Device. Wiki lore says it was either found or created by the Elder as a hunting ground; after the Elder's defeat other powers (Maven, Eldritch Horrors, the Originator) contest it. PoE2 has its own, separate Atlas whose Precursor Towers are mentioned in PoE1 wiki lore.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">endgame_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe1_atlas</data>
      <data key="d10">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": null, "story_order": null}</data>
