    <node id="concept_azmeri_wisps">
      <data key="d1">Azmeri Spirits and Wisps</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Azmeri spirits appear as wisps leading hunters to monsters, introduced with Dawn of the Hunt; Delwyn at Hunting Grounds teaches the hunt; the Spirit Walker ascendancy (0.5) controls Stag, Owl, Bear spirits.</data>
