    <node id="concept_belief_forged_gods">
      <data key="d1">Gods as belief and Beast-energy</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d4">theory</data>
      <data key="d5">Interpretive concept: gods in Wraeclast are sustained by worship and by proximity to the Beast's power; their abilities are 'restricted by the Beast'. Fan synthesis built from wiki statements on godhood and the Beast.</data>
