    </node>
    <node id="concept_citadels_poe2">
      <data key="d1">Citadels (Iron, Copper, Stone)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Three Atlas fortresses (Iron, Copper, Stone) whose bosses drop one Crisis Fragment each toward the Arbiter of Ash: Iron Citadel = Count Geonor, Copper Citadel = Jamanra, Stone Citadel = Doryani, Royal Thaumaturge (agreed by several guides; the poe2 wiki Doryani page also lists the Stone Citadel). The removed 0.1-0.4 epilogue quests Faridun Foray (boss listed Count Geonor), Ezomyte Infiltration (boss listed The Perennial King) and Vaal Incursion (boss Doryani) all start 'Investigate the Burning Monolith'; how The Perennial King maps to Jamanra is unclear. Fragment mapping differs between guides.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">endgame_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_endgame</data>
      <data key="d10">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": null, "story_order": null}</data>
      <data key="d11">[]</data>
      <data key="d12">canon</data>
      <data key="d13">medium</data>
      <data key="d14">[{"source_id": "src_web_timesaver_poe2_citadels", "locator": "Citadel guide"}, {"source_id": "src_web_game8_arbiter_of_ash", "locator": "Iron=Ancient, Copper=Weathered, Stone=Faded per Game8"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_vaal_incursion", "locator": "quest infobox: boss Doryani, Royal Thaumaturge; start 'Investigate The Burning Monolith'; removed 0.5.0"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_faridun_foray", "locator": "quest infobox: boss Count Geonor; removed 0.5.0"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_ezomyte_infiltration", "locator": "quest infobox: boss The Perennial King; removed 0.5.0"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_doryani_royal_thaumaturge", "locator": "can be found in endgame as a citadel boss in The Stone Citadel"}, {"source_id": "src_web_timesaver_pinnacle_bosses", "locator": "Stone (Doryani), Copper (Jamanra), Iron (Count Geonor) - fragment mapping differs from other guides"}]</data>
      <data key="d15">["poe2_endgame"]</data>
      <data key="d16">["poe2_endgame"]</data>
      <data key="d17">["endgame_plot"]</data>
      <data key="d18">released</data>
      <data key="d19">4</data>
      <data key="d20">3</data>
      <data key="d21">2</data>
      <data key="d22">2</data>
