      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d4">narrative_structure</data>
      <data key="d5">The wiki's 'Day Zero' rule: each league's narrative starts with the Exile face-down in the sand of the Twilight Strand, having just been exiled by Dominus, so league stories cannot build on earlier leagues' events.</data>
