    <node id="concept_red_pyre">
      <data key="d1">The Red Pyre</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Entity/title in Ailith's Word of the Dreamer ('The Red Pyre burns hot... The Dreamer once knew him, before his addiction'). The fire imagery and the book's subject (the four Breachlords that became Xesht) point to Xoph, Dark Embers; the identification is inferred, not stated.</data>
