    <node id="concept_rite_of_the_nameless">
      <data key="d1">Rite of the Nameless</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Ritual mechanic/quest stage: place the Head of the King on the Incomplete Effigy in Caer Tarth, use it to select five maps, complete Rituals there to collect effigy parts (Tangled Torso, Mossy Arm, Frayed Cloth, Brittle Arm, Ragged Cloth), activate the Effigy and perform the Rite to reach the Darkness and the Bodach. 0.5.5 campaign unique-boss Rituals work similarly.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">branch</data>
      <data key="d8">["ritual"]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_endgame</data>
