    <node id="concept_vaal_corruption_technology">
      <data key="d1">Vaal corruption and thaumaturgical technology</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Vaal science combined gem-craft, constructs, mechanical technology and corruption drawn from the Beast; much of it was developed by Doryani and housed at Atzoatl and Utzaal. Its influence resurfaces as Vaal side areas, Vaal skill gems and Vaal Orbs in PoE1.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">background</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">vaal</data>
