    <node id="concept_vaal_sacrifice">
      <data key="d1">Vaal sacrifice and Vaal souls</data>
      <data key="d2">["Vaal souls"]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Vaal bloodpriests discovered that the souls of the recently killed briefly seek another source of life and can be captured in a vaal skill gem to empower it; human and blood sacrifice powered Vaal constructs and society, and slavery supplied victims.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
