      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">creature</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Breach-spawn into which the Breachlords were evolving; the Keepers of the Flame, founded through Chayula's dreams, exist to destroy them. The Dreamer is revealed to be of the same kind as the Hiveborn.</data>
