      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">creature</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Ancient subterranean race created, not born, via necromancy, afraid of light; invaded during the Winter of the World and were driven back underground by the returning sun. Antagonists of Abyss and PoE2 Rise of the Abyssals.</data>
