    <node id="deity_beast">
      <data key="d1">The Beast</data>
      <data key="d2">["Darkness", "Nightmare", "The Beast (Act 4)"]</data>
      <data key="d3">deity</data>
      <data key="d4">divine_creature</data>
      <data key="d5">Divine creature, source of thaumaturgy and corruption, grown by Sin from the Dark Ember beneath Highgate to keep the gods asleep. Has no will of its own; exploited by Doryani, Atziri, Chitus, Malachai. The Exile kills it in Act 4; PoE2 follows a new Beast grown from the stolen Seed of Corruption.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">primordial</data>
