    <node id="deity_garukhan">
      <data key="d1">Garukhan</data>
      <data key="d2">["Garukhan, Queen of the Winds", "Orbala", "Queen of the Winds"]</data>
      <data key="d3">deity</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Goddess of wind and sky, formerly the Maraketh Sekhema Orbala ('Sekhema of Sekhemas'); freed Sin from the cliff where Innocence's followers had chained him, became his lover and wife and bore Shakari; Sin planted the Dark Ember 'for Garukhan'.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">primordial</data>
