    <node id="deity_gruthkul">
      <data key="d1">Gruthkul</data>
      <data key="d2">["Gruthkul, Mother of Despair"]</data>
      <data key="d3">deity</data>
      <data key="d5">Bestial minor god, Mother of Despair / Porcelain Queen, a mother whose children were slaughtered by Arakaali and whose grief made her a horned beast; Act 7 Pantheon boss. Sources disagree on the culprit: the God page says Arakaali slaughtered her children; Sin's dialogue says the Vaal laid waste to her kingdom; Sin's 'Mother of Despair' dialogue says her daughters plotted against Arakaali.</data>
