    <node id="deity_kulemak">
      <data key="d1">Kulemak</data>
      <data key="d2">["Kulemak, the Lich Lord"]</data>
      <data key="d3">deity</data>
      <data key="d5">Master of the Lightless and creator of the Lich Lords; exalted within the Well of Souls (which arose after The Master Below All 'raged'), he waged the Winter of the World against the surface until the Three Sisters destroyed his mortal form; his soul returned to the Well. Namesake of the Horns of Kulemak (Immortal Syndicate). PoE2 pinnacle of the Well of Souls content.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">endgame_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">["abyss", "poe2_abyss"]</data>
