      <data key="d2">["Ryslatha", "The Puppet Mistress"]</data>
      <data key="d3">deity</data>
      <data key="d4">god</data>
      <data key="d5">Parasite-queen goddess (a carrion-insect queen covered in parasites) found in the Spawning Ground of the Wetlands. Per Sin she was once a revered matriarch whose children were slaughtered by Tukohama's warriors and who now wants to make everyone's children hers; the Azmeri believed her offspring would one day overwhelm the world. Minor Pantheon god.</data>
