    <node id="deity_sin">
      <data key="d1">Sin</data>
      <data key="d2">["Original Evil", "Sin, the Thief of Virtue", "The Forgotten One", "The Hooded One", "The Hooded One (PoE2)", "Thief of Virtue"]</data>
      <data key="d3">deity</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">God, brother (twin, per the stained-glass windows) of Innocence; planted the Dark Ember beneath Highgate from which the Beast grew. In PoE1 he guides the Exile against Kitava; in PoE2 the Hooded One reveals in Act 2 that he is Sin.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">primordial</data>
      <data key="d10">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": null, "story_order": null}</data>
      <data key="d11">["act_poe1_act10", "act_poe1_act5", "act_poe2_act2", "act_poe2_act4"]</data>
      <data key="d12">canon</data>
      <data key="d13">high</data>
      <data key="d14">[{"source_id": "src_poewiki_sin", "locator": "Lore"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_lore", "locator": "'The Hooded One was likely Sin, owing to his dark appearance, apparent godhood and original planting of the Dark Ember'"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_history_of_wraeclast", "locator": "intro paragraph 3 (Sin plants the Dark Ember; Beast initiates the Slumber of the Gods)"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_order_of_the_templar", "locator": "section 'Lore' (Sin captures Innocence's soul; Sin and the Exile defeat Kitava in Act 10)"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_sin", "locator": "intro"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_the_hooded_one", "locator": "Lore: reveals himself as Sin at the end of Act 2"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_sin", "locator": "Lore, The Beast, In-game interactions, Path of Exile 2"}, {"source_id": "src_ingame_sin_dialogue", "locator": "\"I am Sin, the Forgotten One.\" / Act 6: \"I am Sin, Thief of Virtue, and it is mine to take what I will from the defeated\""}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_sin", "locator": "Lore section 'The Beast'"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_the_trail_of_corruption_act_2", "locator": "Quest log 'Speak to the Hooded One in the Shrine to the Northwest'"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_sin", "locator": "Lore: The Beast"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_the_trail_of_corruption_act_2", "locator": "Hooded One reveal"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_sin", "locator": "The Beast"}]</data>
      <data key="d15">["eternal_empire", "exile_and_sources", "gods_cosmology", "poe1_acts_1_5", "poe1_acts_6_10", "poe2_acts_1_3", "poe2_acts_4_plus", "vaal"]</data>
      <data key="d16">["primordial", "azmeri_ezomyte_ancient", "poe1_campaign", "poe2_campaign"]</data>
      <data key="d17">["main_plot", "background"]</data>
      <data key="d24">[{"domain": "exile_and_sources", "summary": "A god vilified as Sin, who planted the Dark Ember in Highgate to create the Beast and triggered the Slumber of the Gods. In PoE1 Act 10 the Exile and Sin defeat Kitava."}, {"domain": "gods_cosmology", "summary": "God, twin brother of Innocence, 'Thief of Virtue', creator of the Beast and Exile's ally in PoE1 Act 5-10 (sources the Pantheon); husband of Garukhan, father of Shakari. In PoE2 he hides as the Hooded One."}, {"domain": "poe1_acts_1_5", "summary": "Brother of Innocence, creator of the Beast; appears to the Exile in the Chamber of Innocence and saves them from Kitava."}, {"domain": "poe1_acts_6_10", "summary": "Thief of Virtue, twin brother of Innocence and creator of the Beast via the Dark Ember seed; in Part Two he guides the exile to harvest the souls of risen gods and Malachai's lieutenants to forge a new Dark Ember and defeat Kitava. Returns in PoE2 as 'the Hooded One'."}, {"domain": "poe2_acts_1_3", "summary": "God Sin, 'Thief of Virtue'. In PoE2 Act 2 the Hooded One reveals himself as Sin and as the creator of the Beast."}, {"domain": "poe2_acts_4_plus", "summary": "PoE1 god, twin brother of Innocence (the stained-glass version of their tale is Templar propaganda), who planted the Dark Ember/Seed beneath Highgate to grow the Beast and lull the gods; in PoE2 he is the Hooded One (revealed in Act 2)."}, {"domain": "vaal", "summary": "God who created the Beast."}]</data>
      <data key="d25">["codex: identity stated outright in Act 2 (event_hooded_one_reveals_sin)"]</data>
      <data key="d18">released</data>
      <data key="d19">43</data>
