    <node id="deity_solaris">
      <data key="d1">Solaris</data>
      <data key="d2">["Eternal Sun", "Solari (Azmeri)", "Solaris, Eternal Sun", "Solerai (Maraketh)"]</data>
      <data key="d3">deity</data>
      <data key="d5">Eternal/Azmeri sun goddess, twin sister of Lunaris; led a rival cult after Tangmazu tricked her into believing Lunaris betrayed her. Sin has her soul captured for the Pantheon in Act 8. (PoE2 appearance of Solaris/Lunaris by name not verified in the local PoE2 corpus; Maraketh variants Solerai/Lundara and the Three Sisters myth cover PoE2.)</data>
