    <node id="deity_tangmazu">
      <data key="d1">Tangmazu</data>
      <data key="d2">["Black Crow", "Raven Trickster", "Strange Voice", "Tangmazu, the Trickster God (Freya Hartlin)", "Tekaru", "Tekaru the Deceiver", "The Trickster"]</data>
      <data key="d3">deity</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Trickster god (Tekaru to the Karui, Black Crow to the Ezomytes), Ralakesh's brother, said to have made Solaris and Lunaris fight; listed on the wiki as an NPC related to Delirium and, in PoE2, revealed as the disguised Freya Hartlin whose release triggers a Delirium encounter.</data>
