    <node id="deity_xesh">
      <data key="d1">Xesht</data>
      <data key="d2">["Xesht", "Xesht, We That Are One", "Xesht, We Who Are One", "Xesht-Ula, the Open Hand"]</data>
      <data key="d3">deity</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Incomplete union of the Breachlords Xoph, Tul, Esh and Uul-Netol after the five-Breachlord merge failed (Chayula was severed); filled with mindless rage and hunger. PoE1 fought it as Xesht-Ula, the Open Hand; in PoE2 0.5 it is the Breach pinnacle ('Xesht, We That Are One' per a guide), reached through a Breachstone/Realmgate.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">branch</data>
      <data key="d8">["breach"]</data>
