    <node id="event_hooded_one_reveals_sin">
      <data key="d1">The Hooded One reveals he is Sin</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">At a shrine northwest of the caravan, the Hooded One confesses he is Sin, the Thief of Virtue, and that he created the Beast; he sends the Exile south into the long-ago Vaal jungles to find a way to drain the Beast.</data>
