    <node id="event_original_sin">
      <data key="d1">Original Sin (Innocence's ascension)</data>
      <data key="d2">["Original Sin"]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d5">Per Lycia's relics, twin brothers Innocence and Sin lived among the Azmeri; Innocence, unable to attract enough followers, turned his followers against Sin and used their hatred to ascend, leaving Sin blackened. The Templar stained-glass version is propaganda.</data>
