      <data key="d5">Optional Act 3 quest: after obtaining an Inscribed Ultimatum (or the Chimeral Inscribed Ultimatum from Xyclucian), the Exile places it in the Temple of Chaos offering and completes the Trialmaster's Challenges for 2 Ascendancy Points. The PoE2 entry point to the Trial of Chaos ascension trial.</data>
