      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">On the first and second Weapon pieces the Hooded One recognises Precursor writing from a faded mortal memory (a woman's lap, a vivid book; later: sent to live among the Azmeri with a brother and sister, but earlier 'somewhere else' with works of stone, metal and glass).</data>
