      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">quest</data>
      <data key="d5">Optional Fate of the Vaal league quest (0.4.0) that introduces Atziri's Temple. The Exile finds Ancient Beacons surrounded by monsters, sacrifices those monsters and activates beacons (the first, then five, four, three, two and one more), enters the Vaal Ruins, and uses the Temple Console to build and open the first Temple.</data>
