    <node id="event_poe2_breach_questline">
      <data key="d1">Waking the Dreamer</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">0.5 Breach story: travel to the Monastery of the Keepers and the Genesis Tree; defeat It That Was Tul and It That Was Esh (Sky Fortress bosses; official notes: they yield the key to the Breach pinnacle) and retrieve the Breachlord Sac to reach the Dreamer; later fight Xesht. Hiveborn details come from press coverage.</data>
