    <node id="event_poe2_burning_monolith">
      <data key="d1">The Burning Monolith</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Endgame site reached during Legacy of the Precursors ('Reach the Burning Monolith') after the Ancient Gateway. In 0.1-0.4 it was found directly on the Atlas and opened with three Crisis Fragments (The Pinnacle of Flame); in 0.5 it stands inside the Precursor Fortress.</data>
