    <node id="event_poe2_defeat_arbiter_of_ash">
      <data key="d1">Defeating the Arbiter of Ash</data>
      <data key="d2">["Arbiter of Ash defeated; Flame Seed stolen"]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">The Exile kills the Arbiter of Ash at the Burning Monolith. In 0.5 it is a quest boss inside the Fortress and no longer the apex; afterwards a mysterious rider on a wyrm (Tecrod) steals the Flame Seed.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">endgame_plot</data>
