    <node id="event_poe2_defeat_arbiter_of_divinity">
      <data key="d1">Arbiter of Divinity destroys Tecrod; First Edict averted</data>
      <data key="d2">["Defeating the Arbiter of Divinity"]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d5">In the Origin Tower the Exile places the Origin Core; Tecrod's wyrm incapacitates the Exile and Tecrod exults 'With this, the Master shall know unending power!'; the Arbiter of Divinity destroys Tecrod's body ('Your kind shall never ordain the First Edict!') and is then fought by the Exile (quest step 141).</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">endgame_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_endgame</data>
