    <node id="event_poe2_enigma_chambers">
      <data key="d1">Western and Eastern Gateways, Enigma Chambers: Count Geonor and Doryani</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">From the Burning Monolith the Exile clears the Western Gateway (guardian: Precursor Separator) and Eastern Gateway (Precursor Refiner) via levers, then fights Count Geonor in the Western Enigma Chamber (Ancient Crisis Fragment) and Doryani in the Eastern Enigma Chamber (Weathered Crisis Fragment) (quest log; this section of the wiki log is in a hidden comment block, so medium confidence). The Doryani and Geonor fights echo the Citadel bosses of 0.1-0.4.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">endgame_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_endgame</data>
