    <node id="event_poe2_kulemak_encounter">
      <data key="d1">Vessel of Kulemak</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Pinnacle Abyss encounter, the Vessel of Kulemak: Kulemak's Invitation (dropped by Abyssal commanders per guides) sends the player into the Well and the Black Cathedral. Guides say defeating it unlocks the Abyssal Lich ascendancy (exact conditions vary by guide/patch); fully empowering it means defeating the Lich Lords Kurgal, Ulaman and Amanamu.</data>
