    <node id="event_poe2_legacy_of_the_maji">
      <data key="d1">Legacy of the Maji (endgame quest)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Endgame quest begun by finding Aoife near a Ritual Altar: she was killed by the King in the Mists (the King of the Nameless); the Exile destroys his effigies, kills him again at the Crux of Nothingness, takes his Head and Aoife's body, performs the Rite of the Nameless over five maps and defeats the Bodach. Quest complete: 'You have defeated The Bodach and Aoife is finally at peace.' (steps from a hidden comment block).</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">branch</data>
