    <node id="event_poe2_legacy_of_the_precursors">
      <data key="d1">Legacy of the Precursors (endgame quest)</data>
      <data key="d2">["Legacy of the Precursors", "Legacy of the Precursors (Epilogue quest)"]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">The primary PoE2 endgame quest: the Hooded One sleeps, held in thrall by the Beast's Corruption; Doryani proposes recovering Precursor knowledge via the Waygate, leading to the Precursor Tower, the Fortress, the Burning Monolith, the Arbiter of Ash and (0.5) the Arbiter of Divinity.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">endgame_plot</data>
