      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Epilogue/endgame quest of 0.1-0.4: find the Burning Monolith on the endgame map and collect three Crisis Fragments to open the door to the Arbiter of Ash. Removed in 0.5.0 and folded into Legacy of the Precursors.</data>
