    <node id="event_poe2_precursor_halls">
      <data key="d1">The Patriarch and Matriarch Halls</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">After the Arbiter of Ash falls and the Origin Tower is explored, Doryani sends the Exile to the Patriarch and Matriarch Halls: defeat Phyx, Sentinel of the Spark (Origin Spark) and Phya, Sentinel of the Cradle (Origin Cradle); the two are combined in the Precursor Reactor into the Origin Core. Source steps sit in a hidden comment block of the quest log (medium).</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">endgame_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_endgame</data>
      <data key="d10">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": null, "story_order": 6065}</data>
      <data key="d11">[]</data>
      <data key="d12">canon</data>
      <data key="d13">medium</data>
      <data key="d14">[{"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_legacy_of_the_precursors", "locator": "steps 112-137: 'Defeat Phyx, Sentinel of the Spark', 'Defeat Phya, Sentinel of the Cradle', 'Pick up the Origin Spark/Cradle', 'Activate the Precursor Reactor', 'Pick up the Origin Core'"}]</data>
