      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d5">Act 2 main quest: the Hooded One and Sekhema Asala pursue the Beast's trail of Corruption across the Vastiri desert from the Ardura Caravan, through Mawdun Mine, Traitor's Passage and the Halani Gates, the Horn of the Vastiri and Deshar, to the Dreadnought where Jamanra, the Abomination is defeated. Distinct from the Act 1 quest event_trail_of_corruption_act1.</data>
