      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Project that allowed Atziri to commune directly with the Beast. Doryani, privately opposed, was forced to devise it; he learned all he could and prepared contingencies. It triggered the Vaal Cataclysm.</data>
