      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">release</data>
      <data key="d5">About 20 years after Kitava's defeat, Count Geonor pierces the Hooded One with a runic sword and extracts the Seed of Corruption, which begins feeding on a soldier. Corruption spreads across Wraeclast and the Atlas.</data>
