    <node id="event_siege_of_sarn">
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d4">siege</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">[]</data>
      <data key="d1">Siege of Sarn</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d5">On the last day of Divini 1334 IC, High Templar Voll laid siege to Sarn with Ezomyte, Karui and Maraketh rebel support. Cadiro Perandus negotiated Sarn's surrender on 1 Sacrato of Phreci 1334 IC, and Voll was crowned a week later.</data>
