      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">divine_event</data>
      <data key="d5">Sin plants the Dark Ember in Highgate, creating the Beast, the source of thaumaturgy. The Beast initiates the Slumber of the Gods, which puts all gods to sleep.</data>
