      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Around 1160 BC (Trinian, writing c. 1333 IC, says about 2,500 years earlier) the Vaal first contacted the primitive Azmeri tribes of the Azmerian ranges, introducing agriculture and literacy and helping create the first Azmerian written language, while never divulging the secret of virtue gems.</data>
