    <node id="faction_azmeri">
      <data key="d1">Azmeri</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Ancient tribal people of the Azmerian ranges who worship Solaris, Lunaris, Viridi and others. Eighty thousand of them under Tarcus Veruso descended into the former Vaal lands and founded the Eternal Empire in 1 IC; the Azmeri of the Forest Encampment and the Wildwood descend from those who stayed behind.</data>
