      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d4">order</data>
      <data key="d5">Ancient order that venerated the Azmeri Draiocht and practised the mystic arts of the Maji; the Druid (an Ezomyte) was once a member. Wiped out by the King in the Mists and his cultists, who deceived them by disguising himself as a Maji of the old.</data>
