    <node id="faction_eternal_empire">
      <data key="d1">Eternal Empire</data>
      <data key="d2">["Eternals", "Imperial Empire", "Sarn Empire"]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Oriathan/imperial civilisation, also called the Sarn Empire, founded in 1 IC by Azmeri migrants under Tarcus Veruso on the ruins of the Vaal capital. Ruled by Emperors from Sarn, it held most of central Wraeclast with a Roman-style legion system until the Cataclysm (c. 1339 IC) destroyed it; Oriath survived as its successor.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">background</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">eternal_empire_rise</data>
