    <node id="faction_faridun">
      <data key="d1">Faridun</data>
      <data key="d2">["Faridun rogue sect"]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Maraketh rejects (flawed or mutated newborns left in the dunes) raised by wandering Faridun tribes in the Vastiri, who accept necromancy and long for reunification with the akharas. In PoE2 Act 2 the Countess recruits them with the promise of resurrecting Jamanra.</data>
