      <data key="d2">["Gemlings", "Gemling legionnaires"]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Elite legions of the Eternal Empire created by Malachai: legionnaires infused with virtue gems, led by Captains, which gave the Empire military dominance. Chitus carried a master gem whose heartbeat bound every gemling to his own, so they fell when he died; survivors were transformed by the Cataclysm into the Undying.</data>
