    <node id="faction_karui">
      <data key="d1">Karui</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Seafaring warrior people of the southern archipelago. Under King Kaom they allied with Voll's Purity Rebellion, took Lioneye's Watch and founded the first Karui settlement on the mainland; Kaom later fell at Highgate. The Empire had enslaved Karui under Chitus.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
      <data key="d9">azmeri_ezomyte_ancient</data>
