    <node id="faction_maraketh">
      <data key="d1">Maraketh</data>
      <data key="d2">["Sekhemas"]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Desert people of the Vastiri led by Sekhemas, living in akhara (tribes). In 1333 IC Sekhema Deshret joined the Purity Rebellion in exchange for the return of the Vastiri Plains; later, Deshret sealed the Highgate mines. A large tribe lives at Highgate in PoE1; the Ardura akhara and Sekhema Asala appear in PoE2.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
