    <node id="faction_order_of_the_djinn">
      <data key="d1">Order of the Djinn</data>
      <data key="d2">["Djinn"]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Secret society founded in ancient times by the Maraketh and the Clayshaper (Ahkeli) that protects Wraeclast from calamity and guards dangerous artefacts (Forbidden Vaults near the Oasis, Act 9); takes one orphan from each culture. Members forged and delivered the Starforge to the Watchers of Decay (video). Janus Perandus's betrayal let Catarina raid the vault and the Order was slain except Jun and Janus; in PoE2 Jun is rebuilding it. Past members include Ixchel (later the Trialmaster).</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">["betrayal", "kalandra", "mirage"]</data>
      <data key="d9">azmeri_ezomyte_ancient</data>
