      <data key="d2">["Templar Order", "Templar Theocracy", "Templars", "Theocracy of Oriath"]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Theocratic order led by a High Templar that worships Innocence. Within the Eternal Empire it produced figures such as High Templars Andronicus and Voll; after the Cataclysm it governed the unaffected island of Oriath as the Templar Theocracy, with Dominus and Avarius as its PoE1-era High Templars.</data>
