    <node id="faction_twilight_order">
      <data key="d1">The Twilight Order</data>
      <data key="d2">["Twilight Order"]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d5">Secret order, concealed for countless centuries, that rebuilt Oriath while the world believed it abandoned. It aims to free mankind from the 'tyranny of the gods' and build a god-free 'Utopia'; behind the scenes it is plotting to create a new Beast and trigger another Cataclysm. Led by the Countess (Oriana).</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">["twilight_order"]</data>
      <data key="d9">poe2_campaign</data>
      <data key="d10">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": "Hidden for centuries; active ~20 years after the end of PoE1 (PoE1 present is ~1620 IC)", "story_order": null}</data>
