    <node id="faction_vaal">
      <data key="d1">The Vaal</data>
      <data key="d2">["Vaal", "Vaal Empire", "Vaal civilisation"]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Oldest identified civilisation of Wraeclast and in its heyday its most powerful nation; first known users of virtue gems, practitioners of mass blood sacrifice and slavery. All but 3,126 died in the Vaal Cataclysm; survivors assimilated into the Azmeri.</data>
