      <data key="d5">PoE2 Early Access event league (0.5.5, 2026-09-04) built on Ritual altars in campaign and endgame zones, with unique-boss Ritual clusters per act and Sacred Bloom Wildwood encounters; 0.5.5 also integrates Runes of Aldur and Expedition into the core PoE2 game.</data>
