    <node id="loc_lord_s_labyrinth">
      <data key="d1">The Lord's Labyrinth</data>
      <data key="d2">["Eternal Labyrinth", "Labyrinth", "Lord's Labyrinth"]</data>
      <data key="d3">location</data>
      <data key="d4">trial_labyrinth</data>
      <data key="d5">A labyrinth built by Emperor Izaro in 1317 IC as a test to choose his successor, opened on the second Galvano of Azmeri. Chitus won it by betraying Weylin, and later sealed Izaro inside. In PoE1 it is the Act 1 quest that leads to the Trials of Ascendancy.</data>
