      <data key="d1">The Fourth Edict</data>
      <data key="d2">["Fourth Edict"]</data>
      <data key="d3">text</data>
      <data key="d5">Mystery edict. In Legacy of the Precursors (0.5.0) the quest-log step 'Investigate the Fourth Edict' follows the defeat of the Arbiter of Ash; its contents are not revealed in the verified sources.</data>
