    <node id="text_edict_second">
      <data key="d1">The Second Edict</data>
      <data key="d2">["Second Edict"]</data>
      <data key="d3">text</data>
      <data key="d5">Never shown directly. Only Doryani's speculation, after the Third Edict is revealed: 'Perhaps it follows that the Seed was the instrument of a Second Edict... Why would any civilisation intentionally create the Seed of Corruption?'</data>
