    <node id="text_edict_third">
      <data key="d1">The Third Edict</data>
      <data key="d2">["Third Edict"]</data>
      <data key="d3">text</data>
      <data key="d5">Precursor edict whose instrument is the Weapon. After the Hooded One reforges it, the inscription reads 'The instrument of the Third Edict'; the Weapon was 'designed for the sole purpose of cleansing Corruption... and destroying the Beast'. Revealed in Act 4 (0.3.0, whose update bears the name 'The Third Edict'). The Hooded One's wording ('that third mural') implies the edicts are murals he had seen in the Excavated Site.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d8">[]</data>
