      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">text</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Letter by Niko ('Your master, Niko') in the Doomed Mine on the Isle of Kin, urging miners to gather sulphite while a blind beast whispers in the dark. Continues PoE1's Niko (Delve) into PoE2.</data>
