    <node id="text_geonor_edicts">
      <data key="d1">Count Geonor's Edicts (Ogham decrees)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">text</data>
      <data key="d5">Notices posted across Ogham by Count Geonor declaring all crimes punishable by hanging, bodies thrown into a pit beneath his manor; a 'notice of criminality' is found near Clearfell. Not Precursor edicts; the executions fed the Beast seed/creature in the manor cage.</data>
