    <node id="text_letters_of_exile">
      <data key="d1">Letters of Exile</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">text</data>
      <data key="d4">environmental_lore</data>
      <data key="d5">Environmental lore object in Lioneye's Watch: court papers nailed to stakes that give the sentences of named exiles (1597-1599 IC) in the formula 'You are hereby Exiled to Wraeclast where, it is hoped, you shall come to repent your Sins'. Added in version 0.10.8. Distinct from text_letters_from_chitus (Chitus's letters to Cadiro) and text_vaal_letters (Vaal victims' letters).</data>
