    <node id="text_precursor_edicts">
      <data key="d1">Precursor Edicts</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">text</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Vague Precursor murals depicting the Beast (or a precursor of it) and possibly instructions for containing it. The corpus separately says Sin later created the Beast from a Precursor Seed of Corruption; any reading that the Beast predates the gods is interpretation.</data>
      <data key="d6">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d7">background</data>
