      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">text</data>
      <data key="d4" />
      <data key="d5">Seven in-game diary entries (Home, Intrigue, Wonder, Dream, Nightmare, Grief, Awakening) in which Valdo describes the golden device, dreams, Zana's capture and resolving to 'forge a world anew'. Partly superseded by the Book of Memories retcon.</data>
