      <data key="d32">Hooded One recalls a mortal childhood among the Azmeri with a brother and sister and a woman's face, but before that 'somewhere else' (stone, metal, glass). The brother and sister fit PoE1's Innocence and the Forgotten Daughter; the 'somewhere else' hints at a Precursor origin (unresolved inference).</data>
